Hi {{agentFirstName}},

My name is {{senderName}} with {{companyWebsite}}. We're a local Bay Area home buying company, and I came across your listing at {{propertyAddress}} in {{city}}.

We work directly with homeowners who want a straightforward, as-is sale, and I wanted to check whether your seller would be open to discussing a direct offer alongside anything else you're currently evaluating.

We've been buying homes in the Bay Area for {{yearsInBusiness}}, and you can see feedback from past sellers here: {{googleReviewLink}}.

If this could be useful for your seller, I'd welcome a short call. If not, no problem at all -- just let me know and I won't follow up further.

Thanks for your time,
